    {
      "name": "lightcast_classify_occupation",
      "description": "Map raw text (a job title or job description) to Lightcast/SOC occupations via the Classification API. The shared occupation mapping used to keep advisors, dashboards, and websites aligned. Returns matched occupation concepts with confidence.",
